# Candidate warehouse pulls for the source-consolidation comparison. Raw
# evidence, 10MB and reproducible from queries.json `candidate_unit_grain`;
# the conclusions live in docs/SOURCE_CONSOLIDATION.md. Not committed because
# nothing in the build reads them and they would double the repo.
pipeline/raw/candidate/
pipeline/incoming/

# Standalone dashboard builds, e.g. "Parakeet Ops Dashboard 2026-09-22.html".
# The emailable build with React inlined, one command from the committed
# data/dashboard.json:
#     python3 pipeline/publish.py --standalone --out "build/<name>.html"
# Deliberately not committed -- see docs/REFRESH.md. A second 2.9MB copy every
# weekday would add roughly 700MB a year to the repo for nothing.
build/Parakeet Ops Dashboard *.html
